{"seq":38,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0811"},"reason":"Notes now say why Hoover/Carter is contested: US Marines fought Sandino's guerrillas in Nicaragua until 2 January 1933, within Hoover's term, and Carter's only combat operation was the failed 1980 Iran hostage rescue.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://history.state.gov/historicaldocuments/frus1933v05/d763"},{"url":"https://theelders.org/news/only-us-president-who-didnt-wage-war"}],"changes":[{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["=",49],["+"," Strictly, US Marines stayed in Nicaragua, fighting Sandino's guerrillas, until 2 January 1933, during Hoover's term, so his inclusion depends on not counting that intervention as an open war; Carter's only combat operation was the failed 1980 hostage rescue in Iran."]]},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["=",47],["+"," Genau genommen blieben US-Marines bis zum 2. Januar 1933, also in Hoovers Amtszeit, in Nicaragua und kämpften gegen Sandinos Guerilla; Hoover zählt also nur, wenn man diese Intervention nicht als offenen Krieg wertet. Carters einziger Kampfeinsatz war die gescheiterte Geiselbefreiung im Iran 1980."]]},{"field":"notesRu","diff":[["=",39],["+"," Строго говоря, морская пехота США оставалась в Никарагуа и воевала с партизанами Сандино до 2 января 1933 года, то есть при Гувере, поэтому он засчитывается лишь если не считать эту интервенцию открытой войной. Единственной боевой операцией при Картере была неудавшаяся попытка освободить заложников в Иране в 1980 году."]]}],"hash":"32ce459fe9a7","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"170f415e18d3ccc5b15c40aa32f1df2785083b7a091e61fe11e12ca36996e9ab"},
